   6 px minimum plus the 2 px gap no longer fits the page: 49 × 6 px + 48 gaps =
   390 px, which pushed the whole document to ~420 px and produced a horizontal
   overflow at 320 px and 390 px (found by the harness, 2026-10-19). Below the
   first canton breakpoint the columns shrink with the chart instead, so the
   page keeps its width and the chart stays a brush surface; the arrow-key and
   Enter path is unchanged. */
@media (max-width: 599px) {
  .zh-histogram {
    gap: 1px;
  }

  .zh-histogram__bin {
    min-inline-size: 3px;
  }
}

